cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "bag" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'bag: Fetch Public Data and Field Files to Disk'
version: 0.5.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23524742
abstract: Fetches public spatial data and field files and saves them to disk. Sources
  include arbitrary URLs read through GDAL virtual filesystems, the BC Data Catalogue,
  and GeoServer WFS endpoints. Also reads GPX files, converts and inspects GeoPackage
  layers, and backs up field data files.
